PC PC_VendingMachineSelectWrongItem {} @ SelectWrongItem
process SelectWrongItem@St
atom St:'toO.start'
atom SI:'frI.itemSelected'
atom WI:'toO.wrongItem'
after St->SI
after SI->WI
reference RefPCVendingMachineOverall:VMOverall
import VMOverall as VMOI for PC_VendingMachineOverall
ref_connector RefPCVendingMachineOverall->VMOI
after WI->RefPCVendingMachineOverall
